  "body": "The relevant section of the spec is: https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/images.html#sizes-attributes\r\n\r\nI implemented it to the letter in https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1408308, but found a zillion tests failing in WPT.\r\n\r\nThat's because UAs are way less restrictive with it. In particular, Gecko parses a sequence of `<media-condition>? <source-size-value>?`, discarding trailing stuff.\r\n\r\nProbably the spec should just be changed to be less restrictive with the grammar and allow no trailing length and such.",
